Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.49,0:00:15.30,main,Organization Member,0,0,0,,We've been waiting for you, Thorn Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:23.19,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:27.20,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Your garden is as lovely as ever, Shopkeeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.10,0:00:29.20,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,It is, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:34.21,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,By providing water, pruning, \Nand giving consistent care...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.82,0:00:39.34,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,We can ensure that the world \Ncontinues to stay beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.39,0:00:43.14,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,Welcome, Thorn Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.79,0:00:46.48,main,Yor,0,0,0,,The heather smells so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.96,0:00:50.19,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,The leaves of the spindle tree \Nalso look lovely right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.19,0:00:51.02,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.73,0:00:53.49,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.17,0:01:02.67,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Goodness, that startled me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.64,0:01:04.75,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.75,0:01:08.49,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,I feared that your skills may have \Ndulled since you obtained a family...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.49,0:01:10.39,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,But it seems you have not changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.39,0:01:13.51,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,Now I can let you serve our \Nnext customer without worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.51,0:01:17.49,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Of course! I am ready to end \Nany evildoer at any time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.39,0:01:20.67,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,How reassuring. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.01,0:01:23.83,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,You will be providing \Nprotection on this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.27,0:01:25.63,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Protection?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.03,0:03:04.99,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fscx32\pos(490,285)\fad(525,473)}Plan to Cross the Border
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.37,0:03:02.78,top,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,Have you heard of the Gretcher family?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.28,0:03:05.65,top,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,For generations, they have\N been a powerful force
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.65,0:03:08.28,top,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,that has managed this country's \Nunderworld with honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.56,0:03:14.14,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,A little while back, the boss and his \Ntwo sons were killed due to infighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.14,0:03:16.79,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,The only ones of the Gretcher \Nfamily who survived...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.37,0:03:19.85,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,were Olka Gretcher and her son.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.30,0:03:22.89,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,She's being kept in a safehouse for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.89,0:03:26.01,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,But the man who took over their \Norganization, Leonardo Hapoon,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.01,0:03:28.42,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,is desperately trying to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.42,0:03:31.09,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,I hear he's put a tremendous \Nbounty on her head
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.09,0:03:33.82,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,and every hitman in the country \Nand beyond is on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.49,0:03:39.54,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,We've decided to have her seek \Nasylum in another country.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.54,0:03:41.31,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,Her escape route will be on the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.56,0:03:43.79,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,To evade detection by the coast guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.79,0:03:46.51,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,she will go out to sea on \Na normal passenger ship
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.51,0:03:49.08,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,and then rendezvous with a foreign craft.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.32,0:03:54.28,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,I'd like you to stay by her side \Nuntil she is safely handed over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.91,0:03:58.40,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Protecting this mafia person from hitmen...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.80,0:04:02.93,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,Of course, it would be ideal if \Nshe doesn't run into the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.93,0:04:05.05,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,But you are there for insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.33,0:04:09.37,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,The boss who was killed was a man \NI owe a debt of gratitude to,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.37,0:04:11.58,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,so I would very much like you to accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.58,0:04:12.44,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.44,0:04:15.26,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Um, but what about my job at city hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.62,0:04:18.07,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Also, if I'm going to be \Ngone for several days,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.07,0:04:20.29,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I have to think up an excuse \Nto give my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.11,0:04:23.23,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,You needn't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.23,0:04:25.66,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,I had a plan concocted so \Nyou could go on this mission
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.66,0:04:27.93,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,as a part of your job as a civil servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.93,0:04:30.65,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,Your manager will fill you \Nin on the details later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.70,0:04:34.33,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you to \Nhandle this, Thorn Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.33,0:04:37.66,main,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,So that this world can remain beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.93,0:04:41.34,main,Yor,0,0,0,,A-All right... I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.22,0:04:51.07,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,It's been a while since I've had a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.07,0:04:52.70,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I must be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.05,0:04:56.10,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.10,0:04:57.15,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Sis?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.25,0:05:01.76,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It's rare to see you on this train.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:04.61,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah... I just got back \Nfrom a business trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.61,0:05:06.79,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,Actually, I was arresting \Na political criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.79,0:05:09.59,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Well, good work. Would you \Nlike to join us for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.59,0:05:10.33,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Can I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.93,0:05:13.31,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Er, I mean... I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.31,0:05:16.68,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Loidy's at your place, and I've \Nstill got some work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.68,0:05:18.32,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,Like sorting through audio transcripts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.32,0:05:21.15,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Goodness, when will you finally \Njust get along with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.15,0:05:22.42,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.42,0:05:24.14,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Have you been eating properly?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.14,0:05:26.43,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Make sure you're not leaving \Ndirty socks lying around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.01,0:05:30.42,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Sis, I'm not a kid anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.79,0:05:32.92,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.36,0:05:34.68,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.38,0:05:37.48,italicstop,Train announcer,0,0,0,,Now stopping at Fogue Square.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.45,0:05:40.04,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I can't keep clinging to you forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:39.11,italicstop,Train announcer,0,0,0,,Fogue Square.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.04,0:05:41.63,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Though I just did the other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.18,0:05:46.33,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,And actually, you should rely on \Nme if anything ever happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.33,0:05:48.95,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,I'll immediately execute Loidy at any time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.95,0:05:50.07,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.33,0:05:59.70,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.67,0:06:04.52,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I guess Yuri's all grown up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.96,0:06:06.24,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Of course he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.86,0:06:10.21,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,He now has a proper job and \Nis making a living on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.78,0:06:13.06,sign_8868_85_Little_Brother,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(750,1)}Little\NBrother
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.74,0:06:13.05,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,He doesn't need my help anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.94,0:06:19.57,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Is there actually any reason why \NI should continue my job as a killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.12,0:06:23.81,main,Employee A,0,0,0,,Too bad! Your seventh-place prize,\None scrubby brush.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.06,0:06:23.82,sign_9161_90_Scrubby_Brush,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,20)}Scrubby Brush
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.81,0:06:24.95,main,Customer A,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.82,0:06:31.95,sign_9203_92_Grand_Raffle__1_,Sign,0,0,0,,Grand Raffle\N{\fs10\3c&HE8FBF4&\c&H559DAA&} 1 Luxury Cruise\N{\c&H8E968E&}2 Diamond Scrubby Brush\N3 Platinum Scrubby Brush\N4 Crystal Scrubby Brush\N5 Gold Scrubby Brush\N6 Premium Scrubby Brush\N7 Scrubby Brush
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.95,0:06:28.70,main,Employee A,0,0,0,,Step right up! Central Mall's \Nbiannual grand raffle is underway!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.70,0:06:31.95,main,Employee A,0,0,0,,Every 30 dalc spent gets you one ticket \Nyou can use to test your luck in the raffle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.95,0:06:33.63,main,Employee A,0,0,0,,First prize, believe it or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.63,0:06:36.78,main,Employee A,0,0,0,,is two tickets for that luxury cruise \Neveryone's buzzing about lately!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.78,0:06:38.61,main,Employee A,0,0,0,,Keep those tries coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.83,0:06:40.84,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.49,0:06:45.38,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm thinking about going on that boat \Nand having a grand adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.38,0:06:46.97,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I see. How valiant of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.29,0:06:50.17,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Now give the hero Anya the raffle ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.17,0:06:52.12,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Just remember, we only have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.58,0:06:56.06,main,Employee A,0,0,0,,Aw, too bad. Here's your \Nsixth-place premium scrubby brush.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.40,0:06:59.84,main,Customer B,0,0,0,,What the hell, man? Is there even \Na ticket in there for first prize?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.84,0:07:02.89,main,Employee A,0,0,0,,First place has yet to be claimed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.07,0:07:05.35,italics,Employee A,0,0,0,,You fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.35,0:07:08.24,italics,Employee A,0,0,0,,Keep dropping money on a first \Nprize you're never going to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.24,0:07:13.21,italics,Employee A,0,0,0,,That cruise is going to be mine. \NI've made sure of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.53,0:07:16.44,italics,Cindy,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, I know. We're \Nsupposed to act like strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.78,0:07:20.87,italics,Employee A,0,0,0,,The first-place prize ticket is \Nstuck to the top of the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.87,0:07:23.05,italics,Employee A,0,0,0,,None of you are gonna get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.05,0:07:25.02,italics,Employee A,0,0,0,,Call it a perk of working this job!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.91,0:07:28.63,italics,Employee A,0,0,0,,Aren't you excited, Cindy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.28,0:07:33.13,italics,Cindy,0,0,0,,I don't even like cruises, \Nbut whatever. I guess I'll go if I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:32.87,top,Employee A,0,0,0,,Aw, too bad! Here's your \Nfifth-place gold scrubby brush!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.69,0:07:36.70,main,Employee A,0,0,0,,Oh? Are you next, little lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:39.13,main,Employee A,0,0,0,,Here you go. Hope you win!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.37,0:07:42.33,italics,Employee A,0,0,0,,Go on. Hurry up and pick \Na losing ticket, pipsqueak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.33,0:07:44.97,italics,Employee A,0,0,0,,The nice lady behind you is \Ngonna pick the first-place prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.14,0:07:54.40,main,Employee A,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.91,0:07:57.13,main,Employee B,0,0,0,,We have a winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.60,0:07:58.60,main,Employee A,0,0,0,,How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.01,0:08:05.24,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm home, Loid, Miss Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.81,0:08:07.55,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama, hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.54,0:08:10.55,sign_11690_126_Luxury_Cruise,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(530,20)}Luxury Cruise
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.10,0:08:10.54,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya has won a luxury cruise!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.54,0:08:11.24,main,Yor,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.24,0:08:14.83,main,Loid,0,0,0,,She managed to win first prize \Nat a department store's raffle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.83,0:08:16.29,main,Yor,0,0,0,,My, that's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.29,0:08:18.98,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Too amazing. It's making me \Nwonder if it's some sort of trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.98,0:08:20.90,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa is suspicious of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.59,0:08:24.81,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Since there are two tickets, \Nwhy don't you go with her, Yor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.81,0:08:26.02,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I still have to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.02,0:08:28.74,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm so excited! I've never been to the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.74,0:08:30.28,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf, borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.28,0:08:31.60,main,Anya,0,0,0,,You get to stay home, Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.60,0:08:32.92,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.92,0:08:35.56,main,Yor,0,0,0,,The cruise ship {\i1}Princess Lorelei{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.56,0:08:38.33,main,Yor,0,0,0,,This is the ship I'm going \Nto be taking for work!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.33,0:08:39.24,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.24,0:08:42.14,main,Yor,0,0,0,,And it's the exact ship \Nthat's leaving on Friday...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.14,0:08:43.58,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You're going on a ship for work?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.58,0:08:44.32,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.32,0:08:47.79,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Um... the city is trying to attract \Na famous department store,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.79,0:08:50.12,main,Yor,0,0,0,,so I'm entertaining someone \Nvery important from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.12,0:08:53.82,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Ah, must be a modern form of urban planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.82,0:08:58.13,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,It's actually a job to protect a very \Nimportant client from assassins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.13,0:09:00.89,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,A job battling assassins?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.29,0:09:04.86,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,So if they happen to end \Nup on the same ship as me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.86,0:09:08.42,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,it might make my job quite difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.42,0:09:09.83,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.33,0:09:14.73,main,Angel Anya,0,0,0,,We can't cause trouble for Mama. \NForget about this ooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.15,0:09:16.29,main,Devil Anya,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.29,0:09:18.13,main,Devil Anya,0,0,0,,Anya wants to relax on the big boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.13,0:09:20.48,main,Devil Anya,0,0,0,,You're thinking the exact same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.26,0:09:22.21,main,Angel Anya,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.21,0:09:24.30,main,Angel Anya,0,0,0,,If we go and help Mama with her work,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.30,0:09:26.18,main,Angel Anya,0,0,0,,we might be killing two \Nbirds with one stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.94,0:09:31.30,main,Devil Anya,0,0,0,,Be honest with yourself. You know \Nyou just want to go see the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.28,0:09:36.30,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya wants to go on the \Nbig boat! The big boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.30,0:09:38.06,main,Anya,0,0,0,,If I can't, I'm gonna turn bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.06,0:09:39.19,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, dear...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.19,0:09:43.67,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hm... I'll ask my work tomorrow \Nif I can get paid time off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:47.08,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Sure, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.08,0:09:47.90,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.22,0:09:51.35,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I'll pull some strings so you can \Nget time off at the hospital, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.35,0:09:53.70,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Uh... Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.73,0:09:56.78,sign_14236_169_Expectations,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(15,260,330,260,1,154)}Expectations
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.11,0:09:56.77,top,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Be serious! I'm going to work you \Nuntil nothing's left but bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.34,0:10:01.78,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,HQ may or may not be trying to cut \Nback on our shady overtime practices.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.78,0:10:02.57,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.57,0:10:06.07,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Well, little Anya's care and education \Nare part of Strix, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.82,0:10:08.89,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Agent Twilight,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.89,0:10:12.47,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I order you to perfectly execute \Na type of mission called a vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.80,0:10:19.44,main,Anya,0,0,0,,An ooting! An ooting!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.97,0:10:23.04,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya hasn't been on an ooting \Nwith Mama and Papa in forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.97,0:10:26.48,sign_14937_180_Staying_Home,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(78,250)}Staying Home
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.04,0:10:26.47,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It has been a while, \Nthough I'm going for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.97,0:10:29.03,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You'll fall out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.03,0:10:30.76,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,If not for this bodyguard job,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.76,0:10:33.53,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,the three of us could've enjoyed \Nthis vacation together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.08,0:10:37.18,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,What in the world am I saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.18,0:10:39.17,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,That's putting the cart before the horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.17,0:10:40.61,main,Anya,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.45,0:10:43.61,top,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, the next station is \Nwhere we're getting off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.46,0:10:43.00,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,But maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.49,0:10:46.00,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Maybe if...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.49,0:10:49.49,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,this could be my final \Njob as Thorn Princess...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.38,0:10:59.93,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.72,0:11:13.94,main,Anya,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.28,0:11:17.09,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Excited, excited, excited, excited, excited, \Nexcited, excited, excited, excited, excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.09,0:11:18.28,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.25,0:11:24.18,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Well, I have to meet up with my coworkers \Nfrom city hall, so I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.66,0:11:27.03,main,Yor,0,0,0,,If it's possible, I will contact you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.03,0:11:29.60,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm sorry we get to have fun without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:31.12,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama, do your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.97,0:12:01.58,main,Anya,0,0,0,,A pool!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.58,0:12:03.14,main,Anya,0,0,0,,A circus!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.14,0:12:05.07,main,Anya,0,0,0,,A game room!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.07,0:12:06.22,main,Anya,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.72,0:12:10.59,main,Anya,0,0,0,,The ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.92,0:12:14.16,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa, this ship is amazing! \NI feel a big adventure coming on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.16,0:12:17.43,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Well, this luxury cruise ship\N is Ostania's pride and joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.43,0:12:19.20,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Let's hurry and go exploring!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.20,0:12:20.98,main,Loid,0,0,0,,After we put our luggage in our room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.98,0:12:23.55,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Our own suite! So exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.47,0:12:33.69,main,Anya,0,0,0,,It appears we've accidentally come \Nto the jail. This place is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.69,0:12:34.49,main,Loid,0,0,0,,This place is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.49,0:12:36.82,main,Loid,0,0,0,,This is what you're gonna \Nget down in third class.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.08,0:12:40.94,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Please look forward to Anya's grand \Nadventure in our next feature.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.94,0:12:43.90,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You won this cruise in a raffle. \NDon't get greedy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.90,0:12:48.27,main,Anya,0,0,0,,But this is Anya's first bunkbed! \NAnya's gonna live on top!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.57,0:12:49.82,top,Loid,0,0,0,,Do as you please. Just don't fall off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.08,0:12:52.71,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yor and her company are probably \Nin the first-class rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.71,0:12:54.67,main,Anya,0,0,0,,No fair. Darn celebrities.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.67,0:12:57.15,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Well, they {\i1}are{\i0} entertaining guests, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.71,0:12:59.83,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Allow us to formally introduce ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.83,0:13:04.16,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,I am Matthew McMahon, director \Nof policy at Berlint City Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.16,0:13:07.10,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,This is Heymann and Vides from \Nour business development team.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.44,0:13:08.90,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,And this is Forger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.73,0:13:14.42,main,Grey,0,0,0,,I'm Furseal Grey, from the store development \Ngroup at Arhaus Department Stores.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.42,0:13:15.97,main,Grey,0,0,0,,This is my wife, Shaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.97,0:13:17.34,main,Grey,0,0,0,,I apologize for bringing our child along.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.34,0:13:20.10,main,Heymann,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Please, we want you and your \Nfamily to enjoy your time here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.40,0:13:24.50,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,If your wife needs any assistance, \NForger will be happy to help in any way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.50,0:13:25.45,main,Heymann,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.37,0:13:29.37,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,So this is Ms. Olka from the Gretcher family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.37,0:13:31.53,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,She looks completely \Ndifferent from her picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.53,0:13:34.87,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Did she manage to change her \Nface to help her escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.78,0:13:34.48,top,Yor,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.86,0:13:36.13,top,Grey,0,0,0,,Pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.86,0:13:37.69,italics,Grey,0,0,0,,So this is Ms. Olka's bodyguard?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.69,0:13:39.88,italics,Grey,0,0,0,,She seems awfully thin. \NIs she really up to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.88,0:13:42.72,main,Heymann,0,0,0,,This {\i1}Princess Lorelei{\i0} \Ncruise will be a short one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.72,0:13:46.33,main,Heymann,0,0,0,,Three days and two nights, \Njust visiting the nearby islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.33,0:13:49.40,main,Heymann,0,0,0,,We hope you'll be able to relax \Nand enjoy this trip, Mr. Grey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.40,0:13:54.22,main,Vides,0,0,0,,Though it's no department store, \Nthis ship does have a shopping mall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.22,0:13:56.02,main,Heymann,0,0,0,,Would you like to go take a look?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:58.95,italics,Grey,0,0,0,,These two are just normal employees \Nwho don't know the truth, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.40,0:14:00.19,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Sure, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:03.70,main,Olka,0,0,0,,I'm fine. I'll stay here and watch the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.70,0:14:07.11,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,I see. Then we will have \NForger stay behind with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.94,0:14:09.80,main,Heymann,0,0,0,,Right this way, Mr. Grey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.15,0:14:11.81,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Huh? Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.26,0:14:17.14,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Is one bodyguard going to be enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.14,0:14:18.67,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we all stay together?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.98,0:14:21.77,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,She should be quite safe in her room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.77,0:14:24.17,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,We will first be checking \Nthe rest of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.48,0:14:27.87,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,You needn't worry. She is quite strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.58,0:14:35.29,flashback,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,Your mission this time will be \Nto protect the sole survivors
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.29,0:14:37.26,flashback,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,of the Gretcher family, Olka and her son.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.26,0:14:42.11,flashback italics,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,We've received intel that the one \Nafter her has sent several assassins.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.11,0:14:44.42,flashback italics,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,If need be, eliminate the enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.42,0:14:46.60,flashback italics,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Thorn Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.12,0:14:50.71,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,They checked for possible infiltration \Nand escape routes before we left,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.71,0:14:53.59,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,but I can't relax until I \Npersonally check everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.59,0:14:56.29,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm sure the manager is also checking, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.79,0:15:01.41,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Huh... I guess you really are one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.41,0:15:03.46,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.46,0:15:04.38,main,Yor,0,0,0,,One of who?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.20,0:15:09.13,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Um... You are Miss Olka... Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.13,0:15:13.25,main,Olka,0,0,0,,I am. Though I'd prefer that you didn't \Ncall me by that name aboard this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.25,0:15:14.96,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh! I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.77,0:15:18.41,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Oh, did you wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.41,0:15:20.35,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so terribly sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.64,0:15:22.94,main,Gram,0,0,0,,Mama... Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.05,0:15:26.50,main,Olka,0,0,0,,It's so strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.47,0:15:31.74,main,Olka,0,0,0,,I've literally changed my face, \Nbut he still knows that I'm his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.74,0:15:33.66,main,Olka,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's due to my voice, my scent,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.66,0:15:36.33,main,Olka,0,0,0,,and his eyesight not being \Nfully developed yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.33,0:15:41.41,main,Olka,0,0,0,,It is unfortunate that I'll never get \Nto hear, "He looks just like you."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.41,0:15:43.51,main,Olka,0,0,0,,But that doesn't matter right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.51,0:15:47.07,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Besides, he looks like his father, \Nso it'd turn out the same either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.07,0:15:50.60,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Y-Your husband? He seemed \Nlike a lovely person.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.65,0:15:54.34,main,Olka,0,0,0,,The man you just saw is just \Na member of our organization.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.34,0:15:57.61,main,Olka,0,0,0,,He's just playing the part. \NHe is a good man, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.67,0:16:01.59,main,Olka,0,0,0,,My husband was killed along \Nwith the rest of my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.16,0:16:05.68,main,Olka,0,0,0,,That's why the only one \NI have left is my son here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.38,0:16:08.70,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.70,0:16:12.01,main,Olka,0,0,0,,It's fine. You can say this \Nis a gangster's destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.55,0:16:15.14,main,Olka,0,0,0,,But... I'm a bit tired now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.62,0:16:17.80,main,Olka,0,0,0,,I don't need the crime family or its money.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.80,0:16:20.61,main,Olka,0,0,0,,I just want to live a quiet, peaceful life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.08,0:16:30.84,main,Olka,0,0,0,,There, there. What's got you so spooked?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.31,0:16:37.20,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Say, Miss Bodyguard...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:39.16,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Can I be a bit selfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.17,0:16:44.88,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Ever since my family was killed, \NI've been forced to live in hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.33,0:16:47.27,main,Olka,0,0,0,,I'd like to stretch my \Nwings just a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.67,0:16:50.86,main,Olka,0,0,0,,I also want him to be able to \Nbreathe the fresh air outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.86,0:16:54.61,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Um... But without the director's permission...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.61,0:16:56.64,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Please. Just for a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.09,0:16:59.84,main,Olka,0,0,0,,The ones after me don't \Nknow what I look like,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.84,0:17:03.04,main,Olka,0,0,0,,nor should they know that I'm on this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.24,0:17:07.05,main,Olka,0,0,0,,And... you'll protect me if \Nit comes to that, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.64,0:17:10.95,main,Yor,0,0,0,,V-Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.95,0:17:12.77,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Just for a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.87,0:17:21.23,main,Olka,0,0,0,,If you keep acting that suspiciously, \Nwon't you bring more attention to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.61,0:17:27.24,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, er... I am being cautious \Nof the enemy, but, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.36,0:17:30.78,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Your family is on this ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.78,0:17:33.54,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes... My husband and daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.28,0:17:38.12,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa! We need to hurry up and \Nexplore the ship before it sinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.12,0:17:40.07,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It's not going to sink! \NStop scaring everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.07,0:17:42.24,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.59,0:17:44.97,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,This ship certainly is huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.97,0:17:47.42,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,There seems to be quite a \Nfew celebrities present.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.65,0:17:49.58,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Just in case of a terrorist incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.58,0:17:53.04,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I should check for any suspicious people \Naboard and confirm the layout of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.04,0:17:55.89,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I need to figure out which people might\Nassemble, as well as where and when...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.89,0:17:57.69,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa, you're not having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.42,0:18:00.39,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Damn it... My usual habits.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.39,0:18:03.53,flashback,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I order you to perfectly execute \Na type of mission called a vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.01,0:18:05.36,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I must rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:07.93,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I must do my absolute best to enjoy \Nthis vacation to its fullest!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.93,0:18:09.77,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Why don't we go see a show?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.77,0:18:11.37,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,You're so serious, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.68,0:18:14.06,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.06,0:18:16.24,main,Olka,0,0,0,,But why did you bring them with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.24,0:18:19.37,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, I didn't. This was all \Ncompletely coincidental...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.37,0:18:22.08,main,Yor,0,0,0,,My family doesn't know about my real job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.08,0:18:24.60,main,Yor,0,0,0,,So if a battle does happen to break out,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.60,0:18:26.86,main,Yor,0,0,0,,it would be very inconvenient \Nif they were to spot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.86,0:18:30.33,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Then again, having any of the other \Nguests seeing me would be a problem...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.33,0:18:32.08,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Well, if they're in third class,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.08,0:18:35.28,main,Olka,0,0,0,,you probably won't see them \Nunless we go to a common area.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.28,0:18:36.58,main,Olka,0,0,0,,There's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.58,0:18:38.84,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:41.92,main,Olka,0,0,0,,You seem really worried about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.92,0:18:44.07,main,Olka,0,0,0,,That family's just for camouflage, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.84,0:18:48.65,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Yes... You're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.21,0:18:53.14,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Is... that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.75,0:19:01.64,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Oh, right! Let's hurry and step outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.64,0:19:03.26,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.32,0:19:07.72,main,Olka,0,0,0,,I'll let you borrow this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.46,0:19:19.40,main,Olka,0,0,0,,It feels so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.45,0:19:25.84,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Um, this outfit...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.84,0:19:29.40,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Now we just look like two mom friends \Nwho came to enjoy the cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.40,0:19:30.85,main,Olka,0,0,0,,It's better than the suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.85,0:19:36.01,main,Olka,0,0,0,,And if your husband sees you, he probably \Nwon't recognize you from far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.01,0:19:37.66,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes, you do have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.06,0:19:43.16,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.86,0:19:46.15,main,Olka,0,0,0,,What a nice, peaceful breeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.61,0:19:53.74,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Wow... We can't see the shore at all anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.37,0:19:56.66,main,Olka,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.93,0:20:03.40,main,Olka,0,0,0,,I left so much behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.46,0:20:11.84,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Oh, dear. Are you getting cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.39,0:20:13.66,main,Olka,0,0,0,,I guess we can head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.78,0:20:18.02,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Um, Shaty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.11,0:20:22.79,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'll... I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.79,0:20:24.40,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to protect...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.70,0:20:27.29,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I promise to properly do my job!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.91,0:20:30.02,main,Gram,0,0,0,,Besh! Besh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.02,0:20:32.04,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes, I will do my very besh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.04,0:20:35.05,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Gram...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.41,0:20:36.09,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.65,0:20:42.32,main,Olka,0,0,0,,That's his name. Just like \Nmy father's. His real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.32,0:20:43.68,main,Gram,0,0,0,,Dam!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.92,0:20:48.93,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you, Gram!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.93,0:20:51.75,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Want to hold him as we walk back?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.75,0:20:53.17,main,Yor,0,0,0,,May I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.17,0:20:55.31,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I need to do my utmost best \Nnot to break any of his bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.94,0:20:59.81,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry! I'll give him back to you, Shaty!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.81,0:21:04.14,main,Guest (Woman),0,0,0,,Hey, there's a show at five!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.22,0:21:03.84,top,Guest (girl),0,0,0,,Where's the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.84,0:21:05.32,top,Guest (Man),0,0,0,,Let's grab drinks at the bar upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.32,0:21:07.42,main,Guest (Woman),0,0,0,,Wow! You can even go shopping here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.57,0:21:07.96,top,Guest (Boy),0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.96,0:21:09.98,main,Guest (Boy's father),0,0,0,,What's the matter? Don't stray.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.32,0:21:13.58,main,Guest (Man),0,0,0,,I'm certain you will win the next election...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.47,0:21:13.58,top,Guest (Man),0,0,0,,No, no, those stocks right now are...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.58,0:21:17.08,main,Crew,0,0,0,,Well, this isn't good. The lock to \Nthe emergency passage is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.08,0:21:17.83,italics,Crew,0,0,0,,Well, this isn't good. The lock to \Nthe emergency passage is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.42,0:21:20.73,italics,Crowd,0,0,0,,I was almost forced to stay behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.07,0:21:20.73,italicstop,Crowd,0,0,0,,That's why I told you not to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.73,0:21:22.51,italics,Crowd,0,0,0,,Shut up! Next time I'll—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.11,0:21:24.12,italicstop,Crowd,0,0,0,,This company's products—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.51,0:21:24.04,italics,Crowd,0,0,0,,This is so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.39,0:21:25.55,italics,Crowd,0,0,0,,So there you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.55,0:21:27.41,italics,Crowd,0,0,0,,E-226, all clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.41,0:21:29.17,italics,Crowd,0,0,0,,What am I going to do with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.49,0:21:29.81,italicstop,Crowd,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.17,0:21:30.27,italics,Olka,0,0,0,,Gram...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.75,0:21:34.82,italics,Olka,0,0,0,,That's...name. Just like...father's.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.46,0:21:39.44,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,It's a...to meet you, Gram!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.41,0:21:43.82,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry! I'll give him back to you, Shaty!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.24,0:21:46.82,main,Informant,0,0,0,,Shaty, Shaty...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.21,0:21:50.54,main,Informant,0,0,0,,Shaty Hutton, room 2125.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.54,0:21:54.16,main,Informant,0,0,0,,Shaty Copeland, room 3064.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.50,0:21:59.31,main,Informant,0,0,0,,Shaty Grey, room 8053.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:18.04,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,The bright crimson that \Nappears right before my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.75,0:22:27.94,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Stretches approximately 40,000 kilometers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.06,0:22:35.79,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Our wounds that inch closer behind us
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.79,0:22:40.87,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Make us wander even more \Nwhen we're already lost
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.87,0:22:45.46,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,The unseeable, scentless, unmistakable future
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.46,0:22:47.39,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Stabbed me in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.39,0:22:48.55,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.55,0:22:58.09,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Let me stay by your side tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.09,0:23:05.81,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Just for tonight, I'm going to be serious
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.10,0:23:09.68,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Come closer to me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.68,0:23:11.97,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Even the future we prayed for
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.97,0:23:14.00,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Has a different path
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:17.54,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,My dear
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.09,0:23:21.60,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Our malice for each other
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.60,0:23:24.88,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Might just get to us
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.25,0:23:29.48,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Or maybe not
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.10,0:23:40.09,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fscx45\pos(407,285)}The Fearsome Luxury Cruise Ship
